# fable5-gpt5.5-judged — LEGACY cross-family-judging harness for the three-model era.
#
# SUPERSEDED by fable5-gpt5.6-judged (July 2026). Preserved frozen with its original model strings.
# Same cross-model panel as fable5-crossmodel, but GPT-5.5 (codex) does the discernment instead of a
# blind Fable subprocess — the adjudicator is a different model family than the synthesizer. Requires the
# codex CLI; run_judge.sh falls back per SKILL.md if it's missing.
: "${FUSION_PANEL:=fable5,opus4.8,gpt5.5}"
: "${FUSION_JUDGE:=gpt5.5}"
: "${FUSION_CLAUDE_MODEL:=claude-fable-5}"
: "${FUSION_OPUS_MODEL:=opus}"
: "${CODEX_PANELIST_MODEL:=gpt-5.5}"
: "${JUDGE_MODEL:=gpt-5.5}"
